{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) log<sub>2&radic;3</sub>144 এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 6", "option2": "খ) 3", "option3": "গ) 5", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "4", "exp": "log<sub>2&radic;3</sub>144&nbsp;<br />= log<sub>2&radic;3</sub>(2&radic;3)<sup>4</sup><br />= 4log<sub>2&radic;3</sub>2&radic;3<br />= 4 .1&nbsp;<br />= 4"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) দুটি সংখ্যার যোগফল এবং গুণফল যথাক্রমে 22 এবং 96 হলে, সংখ্যা দুইটির ব্যস্তানুপাতিক যোগফল কত?", "option1": "ক) 11/48", "option2": "খ) 12/25", "option3": "গ) 13/30", "option4": "ঘ) 15/56", "answer": "1", "exp": "ধরি,<br />সংখ্যা দুটি a ও b&nbsp;<br /><br />a + b = 22&nbsp;<br />ab = 96&nbsp;<br /><br />(1/a) + (1/b) = (b + a)/ab<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 22/96<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 11/48"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) (m/n)<sup>x - 3</sup> = (n/m)<sup>x - 5 </sup>হলে, x<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 4", "option2": "খ) 16", "option3": "গ) 8", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "2", "exp": "(m/n)<sup>x - 3</sup> = (n/m)<sup>x - 5&nbsp;</sup><br />(m/n)<sup>x - 3</sup> = (m/n)<sup>- (x - 5)</sup><br />x - 3 = - (x - 5)<br />x - 3 = 5 - x<br />x + x = 5 + 3<br />2x = 8&nbsp;<br />x = 4<br /><br /><strong>x<sup>2</sup> = 4<sup>2</sup> = 16</strong>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) (x/3) - (2/y) = 1, (x/4) + (3/y) = 3 হলে, (x, y) এর মান কত? ", "option1": "ক) (3,2)", "option2": "খ) (6,2)", "option3": "গ) (2,2)", "option4": "ঘ) (4,2)", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />(x/3) - (2/y) = 1.................(1)<br />(x/4) + (3/y) = 3.................(2)<br /><br />(1) &times; 3 +(2) &times; 2 &rArr;<br />x - 6/y + x/2 + 6/y = 3 + 6&nbsp;<br />x + x/2 = 9&nbsp;<br />(2x + x)/2 = 9<br />3x = 18<br />x = 6<br /><br />x এর মান (1)নং এ বসিয়ে পাই -<br />6/3 - 2/y = 1<br />2 - 2/y = 1<br />- 2/y = 1 - 2<br />- 2/y = - 1<br />2/y = 1<br />y = 2<br /><br />(x,y) = (6,2)"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) log<sub>x</sub>(2/3) = - 1/2 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 4/9", "option2": "খ) 9/4", "option3": "গ) 2/3", "option4": "ঘ) 3/2", "answer": "2", "exp": "log<sub>x</sub>(2/3) = - 1/2&nbsp;<br />x<sup>-1/2 </sup>= 2/3<br />1/x<sup>1/2</sup> = 2/3<br />x<sup>1/2</sup> = 3/2<br />(x<sup>1/2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = (3/2)<sup>2</sup><br />x = 9/4"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) দুই অঙ্কবিশিষ্ট একটি সংখ্যার একক স্থানীয় অংক দশক স্থানীয় অংকের তিনগুণ অপেক্ষা এক বেশি। অংকদ্বয় স্থান বিনিময় করলে যে সংখ্যা পাওয়া যায়, তা অঙ্কদ্বয়ের সমষ্টির আটগুণের সমান, সংখ্যাটি কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) 37", "option2": "খ) 27", "option3": "গ) 14", "option4": "ঘ) 41", "answer": "2", "exp": "মনে করি, <br />দশক স্থানীয় অংকটি = x<br />একক স্থানীয় অংঙ্কটি = y<br />সংখ্যাটি = 10x + y<br /><br />১ম শর্তমতে,<br />y = 3x + 1 ------------ (1)<br />অঙ্কদ্বয় স্থান বিনিময় করলে যে সংখ্যা পাওয়া যায় তা হলো =10y + x<br />২য় শর্তমতে,<br />10y + x = 8(x + y) -------- (2)<br />10(3x + 1) + x = 8(x + 3x + 1)<br />30x + 10 + x = 32x + 8<br />31x + 10 = 32x + 8<br />x = 2<br />(1) নং সমীকরণে x এর মান বসিয়ে পাই <br />y = 3 &times; 2 + 1<br />y = 7<br /><br />সংখ্যাটি 10x + y = 10.2 + 7 = 27"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) log<sub>2</sub>(log<sub>5</sub>625) এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "2", "exp": "log<sub>2</sub>(log<sub>5</sub>625)<br />= log<sub>2</sub>(log<sub>5</sub>5<sup>4</sup>)<br />=<sup> </sup>log<sub>2</sub>(4log<sub>5</sub>5)<br />=log<sub>2</sub>4<br />=<sup> </sup>log<sub>2</sub>2<sup>2</sup><br />= 2log<sub>2</sub>2<br />= 2 .1&nbsp;<br />= 2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) 2<sup>x +1</sup> = 128 হলে, 5<sup>2x - 10</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 5", "option2": "খ) 6", "option3": "গ) 25", "option4": "ঘ) 10", "answer": "3", "exp": "2<sup>x +1</sup> = 128&nbsp;<br />2<sup>x + 1 </sup>= 2<sup>7</sup><br />x + 1 = 7&nbsp;<br />x = 7 - 1&nbsp;<br />x = 6&nbsp;<br /><br />5<sup>2x - 10</sup> = 5<sup>2&times; 6 - 10</sup> <br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 5<sup>12 - 10</sup> <br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 5<sup>2<br /></sup>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 25"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) 0.125 এর 2 ভিত্তিক লগারিদম কত? ", "option1": "ক) - 4", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) - 3", "answer": "4", "exp": "0.125 এর 2 ভিত্তিক লগারিদম =log<sub>2</sub>(0.125)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = log<sub>2</sub>(125/1000)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = log<sub>2</sub>(1/8)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = log<sub>2</sub>(1/2<sup>3</sup>)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= log<sub>2</sub>2<sup>-3</sup><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= - 3log<sub>2</sub>2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= - 3 .1&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= - 3"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) একজন গার্মেন্টস শ্রমিক মাসিক বেতনে চাকরি করেন। প্রতি বছর শেষে তার একটি নির্দিষ্ট বেতন বৃদ্ধি পায়। তার মাসিক বেতন 4 বছর পর 4500 টাকা ও 8 বছর পর 5000 টাকা হয়। তার চাকরি শুরুর বেতন কত? \r\n", "option1": "ক) 3500 টাকা ", "option2": "খ) 3000 টাকা ", "option3": "গ) 4000 টাকা ", "option4": "ঘ) 4200 টাকা ", "answer": "3", "exp": "মনেকরি,<br />চাকরি শুরুর বেতন x টাকা&nbsp;<br />তার বার্ষিক বেতন বৃদ্ধির পরিমাণ y টাকা&nbsp;<br /><br />প্রশ্নমতে,&nbsp;<br />x + 4y = 4500...................(1)<br />x + 8y = 5000...................(2)<br /><br />(2) - (1) &rArr;<br />x + 8y - x - 4y = 5000 - 4500<br />4y = 500<br />y = 500/4&nbsp;<br />y = 125<br /><br />(1) নং হতে পাই&nbsp;<br />x + 4 &times; 125 = 4500<br />x + 500 = 4500<br />x = 4500 - 500<br />x = 4000"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) (&radic;3)<sup>x + 1</sup> = (3)<sup>(2x - 1)/3</sup> হলে 3<sup>x - 4</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 5", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "(&radic;3)<sup>x + 1</sup> = (3)<sup>(2x - 1)/3</sup><br />(3<sup>1/2</sup>)<sup>x + 1</sup> = (3)<sup>(2x - 1)/3&nbsp;</sup><br />3<sup>(x + 1)/2</sup> = (3)<sup>(2x - 1)/3&nbsp;</sup><br />(x + 1)/2 = (2x - 1)/3&nbsp;<br />2(2x - 1) = 3(x + 1)<br />4x - 2 = 3x + 3<br />4x - 3x = 3 + 2<br />x = 5<br /><br /><strong>3<sup>x - 4</sup> = 3<sup>5 - 4 </sup>= 3<sup>1</sup> = 3</strong>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) দুইটি সংখ্যার প্রথমটির 5গুণ থেকে দ্বিতীয়টির 3গুণ বিয়োগ করলে 9 হয় এবং প্রথমটির 3গুণ থেকে দ্বিতীয়টির 5গুণ বিয়োগ করলে -1 হয়। সংখ্যা দুইটি কত? ", "option1": "ক) 3 এবং 2", "option2": "খ) 2 এবং 4", "option3": "গ) 3 এবং 5", "option4": "ঘ) 5 এবং 4", "answer": "1", "exp": "ধরি,<br />প্রথম সংখ্যাটি x&nbsp;<br />দ্বিতীয় সংখ্যাটি y&nbsp;<br /><br />প্রশ্নমতে,<br />5x - 3y = 9........(1)<br />3x - 5y = - 1...........(2)<br /><br />(1) &times; 5 - (2) &times; 3 &rArr;<br />25x - 15y - 9x + 15y = 45 + 3<br />16x = 48&nbsp;<br />x = 48/16&nbsp;<br />x = 3&nbsp;<br /><br />(1) নং হতে পাই -<br />5 &times; 3 - 3y = 9&nbsp;<br />15 - 3y = 9<br />- 3y = 9 - 15&nbsp;<br />- 3y = - 6<br />y = 6/3&nbsp;<br />y = 2"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) log<sub>10</sub>(x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 5) = 0 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 0", "answer": "2", "exp": "log<sub>10</sub>(x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 5) = 0<br />log<sub>10</sub>(x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 5) = log<sub>10</sub>1<br />x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 5 = 1<br />x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 4 = 0<br />x<sup>2</sup> - 2.x. 2 + 2<sup>2</sup> = 0<br />(x - 2)<sup>2</sup> = 0<br />x - 2 = 0<br />x = 2"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) একটি আয়তাকার ক্ষেত্রের দৈর্ঘ্য প্রস্থ অপেক্ষা 25 মিটার বেশি। আয়তকার ক্ষেত্রটির পরিসীমা 150 মিটার হলে আয়তক্ষেত্রটির প্রস্থ কত? ", "option1": "ক) 30 মিটার", "option2": "খ) 25 মিটার", "option3": "গ) 35 মিটার", "option4": "ঘ) 40  মিটার", "answer": "2", "exp": "মনে করি<br />আয়তক্ষেত্রটির প্রস্থ x মিটার&nbsp;<br />আয়তক্ষেত্রটির দৈর্ঘ্য x + 25 মিটার&nbsp;<br /><br />প্রশ্নমতে,<br />2(x + x + 25) = 150<br />2(2x + 25) = 150<br />2x + 25 = 75&nbsp;<br />2x = 75 - 25&nbsp;<br />2x = 50&nbsp;<br />x = 25&nbsp;<br />"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) 9<sup>x </sup>+ 9<sup>x</sup> + 9<sup>x</sup> এর মান নিচের কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) 1/9<sup>3x </sup>", "option2": "খ) 9<sup>3x </sup>", "option3": "গ) 3<sup>2x </sup>", "option4": "ঘ) 3<sup>2x + 1</sup>", "answer": "4", "exp": "9<sup>x </sup>+ 9<sup>x</sup> + 9<sup>x</sup>&nbsp;<br />9<sup>x</sup>(1 + 1 + 1)<br />9<sup>x</sup> .3&nbsp;<br />(3<sup>2</sup>)<sup>x</sup> .3&nbsp;<br />3<sup>2x</sup> .3<br />3<sup>2x + 1</sup>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) (4<sup>n</sup> - 1)/(2<sup>n</sup> - 1) = ?", "option1": "ক) 2<sup>n</sup> - 1", "option2": "খ) 2<sup>n</sup> + 2", "option3": "গ) 2<sup>n</sup> + 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2<sup>n</sup>", "answer": "3", "exp": "(4<sup>n</sup> - 1)/(2<sup>n</sup> - 1)&nbsp;<br />{(2<sup>2</sup>)<sup>n</sup>- 1}/(2<sup>n</sup> - 1)&nbsp;<br />(2<sup>n</sup>)<sup>2</sup> - (1)<sup>2</sup>/(2<sup>n</sup> - 1)&nbsp;<br />(2<sup>n</sup> + 1)(2<sup>n</sup> - 1)/(2<sup>n</sup> - 1)<br />2<sup>n</sup> + 1"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) log<sub>10</sub>(a<sup>2</sup>/bc) + log<sub>10</sub>(b<sup>2</sup>/ac) + log<sub>10</sub>(c<sup>2</sup>/ab) এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) - 1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "&nbsp;log<sub>10</sub>(a<sup>2</sup>/bc) + log<sub>10</sub>(b<sup>2</sup>/ac) + log<sub>10</sub>(c<sup>2</sup>/ab)<br />=log<sub>10</sub>{(a<sup>2</sup>/bc) &times; (b<sup>2</sup>/ac) &times; (c<sup>2</sup>/ab)}<br />=log<sub>10</sub>1<br />= 0"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) কোন প্রকৃত ভগ্নাংশের লব ও হরের যোগফল 22 এবং বিয়োগফল 8 হলে ভগ্নাংশটি কত? ", "option1": "ক) 9/19", "option2": "খ) 5/13", "option3": "গ) 3/11", "option4": "ঘ) 7/15", "answer": "4", "exp": "মনে করি, <br />প্রকৃত ভগ্নাংশটির লব = x<br />প্রকৃত ভগ্নাংশটির হর = y<br />&there4; ভগ্নাংশটি = x/y<br /><br />প্রশ্নমতে,<br />x + y = 22...........(1)<br />y - x = 8 ..........(2)<br />(1) + (2) পাই&nbsp;<br />2y = 30<br />y = 15<br /><br />y এর মান (1) বসিয়ে পাই,<br />x + 15 = 22<br />x = 22 - 15&nbsp;<br />x = 7<br />ভগ্নাংশটি = x/y = 7/15"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) 2log<sub>10</sub>5 + log<sub>10</sub>8 - (1/2)log<sub>10</sub>4 = ?", "option1": "ক) 100", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "2log<sub>10</sub>5 + log<sub>10</sub>8 - (1/2)log<sub>10</sub>4&nbsp;<br />= log<sub>10</sub>5<sup>2</sup> + log<sub>10</sub>8 - log<sub>10</sub>4<sup>(1/2)<br /></sup>= log<sub>10</sub>25 + log<sub>10</sub>8 - log<sub>10</sub>(2<sup>2</sup>)<sup>1/2</sup><br />= log<sub>10</sub>25 + log<sub>10</sub>8 - log<sub>10</sub>2<br />= log<sub>10</sub>(25 &times; 8 &divide; 2)<br />= log<sub>10</sub>100<br />= log<sub>10</sub>10<sup>2</sup><br />= 2log<sub>10</sub>10<br />= 2 .1&nbsp;<br />= 2"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) (0.25)<sup>-1.5 </sup>= ?", "option1": "ক) 4", "option2": "খ) 16", "option3": "গ) 8", "option4": "ঘ) 32", "answer": "3", "exp": "(0.25)<sup>-1.5</sup><br />= (25/100)<sup>-15/10</sup><br />= (1/4)<sup>-3/2</sup><br />= (4)<sup>3/2</sup><br />= (2<sup>2</sup>)<sup>3/2</sup><br />= 2<sup>3</sup><br />= 8"}]}, "exam_time": 1320000, "pk": 3337, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 3337}